doc_id: development-index
title: Development Documentation Index
project: ai-workflow
version_hint: "2024-2025"
kind: development_index
description: Navigation index for development documentation covering code patterns, standards, and best practices.
scope: Provides overview and navigation to all development-related documentation files with topic summaries and usage guidance.
module_organization:
  description: Development documentation is organized into four specialized modules for targeted guidance.
  note: All pattern documents have been successfully split into Python, FastAPI, SurrealDB, and Elasticsearch modules for clear separation of concerns and improved discoverability.
  modules[4]:
    - name: python
      path: python/
      description: Pure Python patterns including documentation standards, exception hierarchies, and dependency injection concepts not specific to any framework.
      consult_when: Writing Python code, docstrings, or implementing generic patterns.
    - name: fastapi
      path: fastapi/
      description: FastAPI-specific patterns including routers, Depends() injection, middleware, lifespan management, and OpenAPI documentation.
      consult_when: Building API endpoints, configuring middleware, or wiring FastAPI dependencies.
    - name: surrealdb
      path: surrealdb/
      description: SurrealDB-specific patterns including connection pooling, repository implementations, and query patterns.
      consult_when: Working with SurrealDB persistence, writing repository code, or managing database connections.
    - name: elasticsearch
      path: elasticsearch/
      description: Elasticsearch-specific patterns including client configuration, search query patterns, and index management.
      consult_when: Implementing search functionality, configuring Elasticsearch clients, or managing indices.
